WEBVTT

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.140
It was Christmas Eve.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.770
As I sat there sniffling
after my girlfriend dumped me.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:39.150
Then Santa-san offered me
a package of tissues.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.030
So, guess what happened next.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.410
I was quite shocked, actually.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:23.040
Matsunaga-kun, what did
you do during your break?

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.620
Hey, we should do karaoke sometime!

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:26.860
Mattsun!

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.380
That hurt!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.770
I found her!

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:33.490
Found who?!

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.300
Santa-san!

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:35.430
What?!

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:36.230
Mattsun!

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:38.220
I'm telling you the truth!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.120
Oh, Na-chan.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.460
Good morning!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.450
Kei-chan, listen to me!

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.640
You're energized for
the new semester...

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.770
Anyway, during Christmas I
met this Santa-san, right?

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.930
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.700
Turns out she's a student here!

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:52.940
She's wearing the scarf!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.620
You're being a bit loud...

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:58.160
Oh, it's the scarf I meant
to give to my ex-girlfriend.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.450
But Santa-san looked
cold, so I gave it to her!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.960
Keep your voice down a bit...

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:02.710
I was going to ask you guys
on how I should approach her!

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:03.850
Good morning.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:04.580
Morning.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:05.390
What are they talking about?

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.910
Why are you whipping it out!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:07.750
Shut up.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:09.920
I see.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:12.120
So that's how you met her.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.880
You could have just called out to her.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.910
But, the tissues she gave me were for a karaoke place.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.950
She was handing out advertisement.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.740
Then she'll probably not remember you.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:27.280
But, she's using a scarf which
a complete stranger gave to her.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.150
It might be possible...

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.740
What is possible?

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.750
It kind of feels like fate, you know?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.160
She handed me tissues when I needed
them and now she's using my scarf.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.030
Oh, looks like he's in <i>Maiden Mode.</i>

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.200
He's only seeing the
maiden he wants to see.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.890
Delusional.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.620
Well, it can't be helped...

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.170
Let me know if you see her.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.070
I'll talk with her and
get an opening for you.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.130
Really?

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.540
How will you approach her?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:58.390
Let's see, I guess...

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:00.720
You're pretty cute, aren't you?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.880
What the...

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.430
Hashiba-kun.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.850
Oh, Nii-chan.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:09.020
It's Sensei when we're
at school, Katakura-kun.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.320
Hashiba-kun, you have class duty today.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.610
I need your help with something, is that okay?

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.070
Um, sure.

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.530
Just me?

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.730
A second person would be nice.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.530
Hey, could one of you...

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.580
Good luck!

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.660
Heartless jerks...

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.970
The four of you are really so close.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.740
but you can be so different,
which is quite funny.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.750
It's not funny.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.300
They're all so cold!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.550
Keiichi too?
Well, he's kind of like a second son.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.710
Sensei, do you know every
student in this school?

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.000
Huh, why?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.600
I'm looking for someone.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.810
A girl, with short light brown hair.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.070
I guess she's pretty quiet...

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:57.070
Also, I think she works part-time
at a karaoke place.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:00.390
Hmm, a lot of girls would
fit that description.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:01.400
Sensei...

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.170
Oh.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.780
Are you awake already?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.250
Are you feeling better now?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.420
Yes.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.420
<i>That's her!</i>

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.790
<i>Wh-Why was she sleeping?</i>

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.450
<i>Why in this place?</i>

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.770
Hold up.

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.140
Are you still feeling dizzy?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.740
We have a guest, so put on your blazer.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.060
Right.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.000
Sensei, I'll be going.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.150
Take care.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.230
Sensei, who was that?

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.890
Oh, Kobayakawa-san,

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.460
she comes here sometimes, with reasons.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.010
But, I don't want people to think
that I'm giving her special treatment.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:01.530
<i>Reasons?</i>

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.140
<i>What reasons?</i>

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:04.650
Hashiba-kun.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:05.300
Yes?

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.110
Could you please keep this a secret?

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.180
Uh, of course!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.100
She has a guy?!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.060
And it's Katakura-sensei?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.450
Why else would she be
sleeping in that room?

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.540
What do you think, Otouto-kun?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.480
You're asking me?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:23.410
Nii-chan doesn't tell me much
about himself, he never has.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:27.520
Na-chan, do you like this Kobayakawa-san?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.280
Huh?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.790
Are you just curious,

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.710
or is this love? I wonder.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.220
I guess I'm pretty curious about her...

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.180
But it's pretty shocking...

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.670
If you're not sure, forget I asked.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.210
Yeah, I have no idea, so I'll sing!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.830
Sing!

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.150
Pardon my intrusion.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.200
Here are the drinks you ordered.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.280
Who ordered cola?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.020
Oh, me.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.910
And the iced coffee?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.860
That would be me.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.190
Oh, you're that guy from earlier.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.110
Yes, I'm Hashiba.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.500
Hashiba-kun.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.950
Please enjoy yourself.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.420
Uh, yeah!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.280
That was her, right?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.410
Hmm.

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:22.210
I'm in love.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.260
From that?

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.170
She had no expression, the whole time!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:31.010
I'm just happy about the fact
that she remembers me, you know?

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.260
Also, waitresses who don't
smile are pretty rare.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.390
It makes me want to
see her smile even more...

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.470
Oh, so you just want to see her face when
she can't take any more more embarrassment,

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:43.690
or her face distorted with pain, right?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.060
I totally get it!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.950
Yeah, you really don't, sorry.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.800
For starters, I'll order another drink and
hope Kobayakawa-san comes again.

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:52.830
Hello?

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:53.700
We're gonna sing!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.050
She didn't come at all...

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:02.140
Are you okay?

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.480
Haven't had enough drinks?

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.370
Yeah...

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:06.880
Be right back, bathroom.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.390
Go for it!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.450
If you're a real man, help her!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.430
I believe in you, Na-chan!

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.830
B-But how?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.190
That doesn't matter.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.290
Just do whatever!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.430
You can do it, Na-chan!

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:30.320
Show her your cool side!

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.450
H-Hey...

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.690
Think of something....

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:43.580
P-Please, stop bothering my girlfriend!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:48.760
Um...

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.800
Y-Yes, what is it?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.770
This is where we run, right?

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.420
Yeah, let's do that.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:57.480
Um, that's not it.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:01.110
It looks like these gentlemen
don't speak Japanese.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.150
What?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.280
Huh?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.360
Gross!

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.620
This is where I come in.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.720
Are you still breathing?

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:22.830
You okay?

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.440
Good morning...

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.050
She's <i>my</i> woman, you got it?

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.670
Get your filthy hands away!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.510
Kyuu!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.570
Oh, good morning, Na-chan.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:42.650
Yesterday was hilarious.

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.910
You were the best, Na-chan!

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:45.890
Guys...

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.160
You're so mean!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.620
What, you're crying?!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:50.610
Um, sorry.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.340
It was so funny,
we couldn't help ourselves.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.610
I'm just really shocked...

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.030
We get it, here, blow your nose.

00:09:58.170 --> 00:09:59.180
Have some gum.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.900
Na-chan, it'll be okay.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:05.880
Everyone fails once or twice.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.500
Tsuyopon...

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.980
Anyway, shouldn't her relationship
with Sensei shock you more?

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.660
This isn't the time!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.000
He'd probably forgotten about that!

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.900
Na-chan is wrapped in darkness...

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:25.720
Naoe-kun, I'm collecting
the math class' homework.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.940
I'll tell Na-chan to turn in his later.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:32.900
I'm sure that I just have no luck with
girls, I'm not suited for romance...

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.570
And they didn't even turn in my notebook.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.280
Pardon my intrusion.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.260
I forgot to turn in my notebook
earlier, so I brought it.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.710
He's not here.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.410
Sensei?
